# Shot list — "The Paper Lantern"

All shots: 1280x720, 24 fps, each made from one still image (or a small set of layers from it) with a slow camera move. Moves are slow and smooth (no faster than ~4% of frame width per second for pans; pushes ≤ ~10% scale over the shot), never jittery, never revealing the image edge. Cuts or short dissolves (≤ 12 frames) between shots; a fade from black at the start and a fade to black at the end.

