| 1 | 2.0–5.5 | 3.5 | wide | river at dusk, village with warm windows on the bank, dusk sky with first stars | slow pan (left→right, matching the river's flow direction in later shots) | not yet, or unlit in child's hands far away | optional tiny figure at the water's edge |
| 2 | 5.5–9.0 | 3.5 | medium | child kneeling at the water's edge holding the lit lantern; glow on the face | slow push in | lit, held in both hands | full figure or ¾, face lit warm |
